				\begin{document}$$P{D}_{12}$$\end{document}PD12 represents the effect of the change from no to slight pain or discomfort. This effect is negative and insignificant in both the conditional logit models as well as the confirmatory bivariate mixed logit, which seems to suggest that U.S. adults are unwilling to sacrifice life years to relieve slight pain or discomfort. Further research is needed to verify this effect. The incremental effect \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
