				\begin{document}$${r}_{i}=r$$\end{document}ri=r), Jonker and colleagues [5] estimated the mixed logit model with a random hyperbolic discount rate and found strong evidence for non-linear time preferences. In this study, we extended both approaches and estimated a bivariate mixed logit model allowing a correlation between scale and power.
